WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A customer submits a ticket.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
The model predicts team, refund intent and urgency.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Software validates. Humans review uncertain decisions.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Approved decisions drive routing and priority.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
An approved template creates the acknowledgement.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Model predicts. Software acts.
